College Kings 2 Episode 2 ‘The Pool Party’ is coming to Steam this Fall.

[previewyoutube=gKF2lSQN4Bg;full][/previewyoutube]

In the upcoming story you can look forward to:

▶️ An epic pool party blowout, full of hot girls, bikinis, and sunscreen massages;
▶️ Lauren’s lingerie line, which you can help bring to life;
▶️ And Penelope using her computer skills for good by designing her own adult visual novel.

Episode 2 aims to improve upon Episode 1 with:

✅ More realistic and lifelike character personalities;
✅ A more entertaining, engaging, and hilarious gameplay story;
✅ More authentic romance & love;
✅ Wilder and steamier sex scenes;
✅ Countless player choices with loads of replayability;
✅ Gorgeous graphics and cinematic artwork; and
✅ More beautiful high-definition animations.

